      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Let me read the original test file first.Now I understand the test. The main understandability issues are:\n- Single-letter variables `n`, `m`, `s` obscure what they represent (the exponential factor and partial derivatives)\n- The interleaving of computation and assertion makes it hard to follow the logic\n\nLet me write an improved version with meaningful variable names.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version replaces the cryptic single-letter variables (`n`, `m`, `s`) with descriptive names (`distFromMean`, `expFactor`, `expectedGradNorm`, `expectedGradMean`, `expectedGradSigma`) and adds inline comments explaining the mathematical formula for each partial derivative, making the intent immediately clear to a reader."
